 "target": 64.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A dying railway was saved by one cat in a hat.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 2.335
  },
  {
   "text": "Her uniform: a little station master cap. Her salary: cat food.",
   "s": 2.635,
   "e": 6.104
  },
  {
   "text": "But before her, the station was so empty, crickets bought the tickets.",
   "s": 6.404,
   "e": 9.725
  },
  {
   "text": "The railway was broke, so it sent every worker home.",
   "s": 10.025,
   "e": 12.362
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they planned to shut the whole line down.",
   "s": 12.662,
   "e": 14.406
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a shopkeeper's stray cat, Tama, moved into the ticket booth.",
   "s": 14.706,
   "e": 17.711
  },
  {
   "text": "So the boss made it official: Tama was the new station master.",
   "s": 18.011,
   "e": 21.178
  },
  {
   "text": "She greeted every train, sitting perfectly still by the gate.",
   "s": 21.478,
   "e": 24.278
  },
  {
   "text": "Kids waved. Grandmas bowed. Tama yawned.",
   "s": 24.578,
   "e": 26.812
  },
  {
   "text": "And that's when things got weird.",
   "s": 27.112,
   "e": 28.314
  },
  {
   "text": "Tourists started showing up. Ten, then a hundred, then whole busloads.",
   "s": 28.614,
   "e": 31.966
  },
  {
   "text": "Trains were packed with people who only wanted to see a cat.",
   "s": 32.266,
   "e": 34.693
  },
  {
   "text": "In one year, she brought the town millions.",
   "s": 34.993,
   "e": 36.698
  },
  {
   "text": "So the railway promoted her: super station master, with a gold hat.",
   "s": 36.998,
   "e": 40.542
  },
  {
   "text": "She even got her own office, with a tiny desk.",
   "s": 40.842,
   "e": 42.934
  },
  {
   "text": "But could a cat get any more famous?",
   "s": 43.234,
   "e": 44.695
  },
  {
   "text": "They rebuilt the entire station to look like her face.",
   "s": 45.465,
   "e": 47.955
  },
  {
   "text": "Ears on the roof. Whiskers on the windows.",
   "s": 48.255,
   "e": 50.194
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they painted a whole train with her on every seat.",
   "s": 50.494,
   "e": 52.841
  },
  {
   "text": "Fans waited in line for hours to ride it.",
   "s": 53.141,
   "e": 54.955
  },
  {
   "text": "All because one cat sat by a gate and blinked.",
   "s": 55.255,
   "e": 57.417
  },
  {
   "text": "That's how a cat in a hat saved a railway.",
   "s": 57.717,
   "e": 59.51
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow for a new weird story every day.",
   "s": 59.81,
   "e": 61.634
  }
 ],
